    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "NWA\nLockheed Turbo Constellation as flown by Northwest Orient Airlines",
      "POST\nThe Turbo Constellation, the world's finest overseas air-\nliner, is flown on trans-pacific routes of Northwest Orient\nAirlines. Four great turbo-compound engines, each devel-\noping 3,250 horsepower, speed you along at over 300\nmiles per hour. Completely air-conditioned cabin assures\nyou a comfortable flight. Panoramic windows are tinted\nfor easy vision.\nPF 16-V-55\nCARD\n- NORTHWEST ORIENT AIRLINES PHOTO-PRINTED IN U. S. A.\n2015.166.1126"
    ],
